Build and installation instructions

AS uses CMake and requires a C11 compiler, CMake 3.19 or newer, and Git.
From the source directory, run:

    cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja
    cmake --build build -j
    ctest --test-dir build -j --output-on-failure
    cmake --install build

Ninja must be installed when using the Ninja generator. Other CMake
generators may be selected instead. Installation into system directories
may require administrative privileges.

See README.md for supported environments, cross-compilation, installation,
and documentation generation with Pandoc. Source modification guidance is
in doc/modifying-as.md.
